      "text": {
        "en": "Most pet owners express sincere appreciation for the veterinary surgeons, vet nurses, and receptionists at Glasgow East PDSA. Multiple clients highlight that the team demonstrates immense kindness and empathy during stressful consultations and end-of-life care. While a couple of reviewers found certain staff members rushed or unhelpful, the majority describe a dedicated and caring clinical team."
      }
