      "title": {
        "en": "Dedicated care for sick pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently highlight the attentive treatment given to dogs, cats, and kittens requiring urgent or ongoing veterinary attention. Pet owners note that veterinary teams handle unwell animals with patience, helping ease anxiety during physical examinations and procedures. Many reviewers credit the hospital with saving their pets' lives during critical illnesses."
      }
    },
    {
