      "text": {
        "en": "Many pet owners report successful outcomes, lifesaving interventions, and thorough assessments for conditions such as tumours and physical injuries. However, client experiences are mixed: several owners felt that diagnoses were missed or that their pets did not receive sufficiently detailed examinations during initial emergency consultations, prompting them to seek second opinions elsewhere."
      }
    }
